# which clip she plays, when that changes, and when something in a clip happens. See engine/animgraph.inc. It's read again when this file changes.
state idle  idle   loop 1
state walk  w_walk loop gait
state run   w_run  loop gait
state punch punch  once 1.6
state jump  jump   once 1
state fall  fall   loop 1
when any   jump  jump
when any   punch punch
when punch idle  end
when jump  fall  end
when fall  idle  grounded>0.5
when idle  walk  speed>0.35
when walk  idle  speed<0.25
when walk  run   speed>5
when run   walk  speed<4.5
when idle  fall  grounded<0.5
when walk  fall  grounded<0.5
when run   fall  grounded<0.5
event punch 0.35 hit
event walk 0.25 step
event walk 0.75 step
event run 0.25 step
event run 0.75 step
